Cool (Alesso song): "Cool" is a 2015 song by a Swedish electronic musician Alesso featuring vocals from American singer Roy English (also known by his real name Brandon Wronski), the frontman of the former American rock band Eye Alaska.  It premiered on February 13, 2015 on BBC Radio 1.  The track, which samples Kylie Minogue's "Get Outta My Way", was officially released in Europe on 16 February 2015 and in North America on 17 February 2015.  The song was released on 26 April 2015 in the UK.

